nginx-mod-brix-cache (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Debian/Ubuntu packaging of BriX-Cache 1.4.0.  Full release notes live in
    CHANGELOG.md; the authoritative package changelog is the RPM spec's
    %changelog (packaging/rpm/nginx-mod-brix-cache.spec).  This file is a
    fallback for direct dpkg-buildpackage runs — packaging/deb/build-deb.sh
    regenerates it with the version derived from src/core/ident.h
    (BRIX_SERVER_VERSION_BARE) and the target Ubuntu codename.

